<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's National Property to proceed with 1/4 issue.</title>
<headline>NZ's National Property to proceed with 1/4 issue.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Property Trust said on Thursday that with shareholders approving a NZ$9 million capital raising it would proceed with a placement and a one-for-four renounceable cash issue.</p>
<p>Unitholders will be offered the issue at 90 cents per unit. Up to one million extra units will be offered.</p>
<p>Unit holders have approved the purchase of Hewlett Packard House in Wellington.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
